Since April, people have reported bookings landing on the wrong day. The desk merged overlapping export rows into #4471.

The report IDs must be deduplicated before counting. The cause follows the tenant locale, booking form, and channel—not the intake tag, which is only a guess.

Separate issues now track the day-first parser failure and the booking-v3 date-hint failure: [parser issue](https://github.com/pmatysek/MEGA.dev.s01e03/issues/1) and [form-hint issue](https://github.com/pmatysek/MEGA.dev.s01e03/issues/2).

<Callout>
Known, but not one fix: track the parser and form-hint failures separately.
</Callout>

